  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/19834c919966288c99419a07884d09739eed61fb7b636905d29e78d8456bb0d3.png] \n\n \n \n\n **Letters**\n P\n Q\n R\n S\n T\n U\n V\n \n \n\n **Means**\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n =\n >\n \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **15 S 3 R 4 T 4 R 5**\n\n→ **15 ****÷**** 3** × 4 = 4 × 5\n\n→ **5 ****×**** 4** = **4 ****× 5**\n\n→ 20 = 20\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n2) **15 P 3 Q 4 R 4 T 5**\n\n→ 15 + 3 - **4 ****×**** 4** = 5\n\n→ **15 +**** 3** - 16 = 5\n\n→ 18 - 16 = 5\n\n→ 2 ≠ 5\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **15 U 3 R 4 P 5 P 4**\n\n→ 15 > **3 ****×**** 4** + 5 + 4\n\n→ 15 > **12 +**** 5 + 4**\n\n→ 15 > 21 → This is not correct.\n\n4) **15 T 3 Q 4 P 4 Q 5**\n\n→ 15 = **3** - 4 **+ 4** - 5\n\n→ 15 = 7 - 4 - 5\n\n→ 15 = -2\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.",
